    {
      "title": "MTA vs MMM (and the unified view)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Treating these as either/or is outdated. Unified Marketing Measurement (UMM)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#mta-vs-mmm-and-the-unified-view",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "combines MMM (strategy) + MTA (tactics) + experiments (ground truth). Neither MTA",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#mta-vs-mmm-and-the-unified-view",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "nor MMM is causal by itself - only experiments are; experiments calibrate both.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#mta-vs-mmm-and-the-unified-view",
          "note": null
        }
