          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "function itself, so **more lift tests at different spend levels keep improving",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#calibrating-mmm-with-experiments",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "the curve**, not just one anchored ROAS point.",
