    {
      "title": "Practical Patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Transform order: spend → adstock (carryover) → saturation → linear term.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Getting the order wrong inverts the economics.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "2-3 years of weekly data typical; ensure spend variation per channel (a",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "channel with flat spend is unidentifiable).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Decompose first: isolate baseline (trend, seasonality, holidays, price,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "promo, distribution) so media coefficients capture incremental media effect.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Validate with holdout / time-series CV and NRMSE / R²; check residuals.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Calibrate, then optimize: anchor channels to experiments before trusting the",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "budget optimizer's reallocation.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Report uncertainty: present credible intervals on ROI, not point estimates,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "to set decision risk.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Quarterly experiment cadence keeps the MMM honest as creative, audiences,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "and saturation shift.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Anti-Patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Treating MTA last-click as incrementality - it credits demand that would",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "have converted anyway; inflates ROAS on bottom-funnel/retargeting.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Skipping calibration - uncalibrated MMM ROIs are easily confounded by",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "collinear channels (TV and search rising together) and will misallocate budget.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Over-trusting the optimizer beyond the observed spend range - saturation",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "curves extrapolate poorly; cap reallocation to a sane band of historical spend.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Ignoring carryover - fitting media to same-week sales only understates TV /",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "brand and overstates fast-response channels.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Reusing LightweightMMM for new builds - deprecated; migrate to Meridian.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "One-and-done MMM - a model not re-fit/re-calibrated drifts within a quarter.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Underpowered geo tests - running a test too short or with too few geos",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "yields wide intervals and an inconclusive read presented as \"no lift.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Troubleshooting",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Implausible / negative channel ROI → multicollinearity; add experiment",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "priors, drop/aggregate correlated channels, or use ridge (Robyn) / stronger",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Saturation curve looks linear (no diminishing returns) → insufficient",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "high-spend observations; add lift tests at higher spend, or constrain priors.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "MMM and lift test disagree → trust the experiment; recalibrate. Persistent",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "gaps suggest omitted controls or wrong adstock length.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Geo test inconclusive → re-run power analysis; lengthen post-period for",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "delayed conversions; verify control geos match the pre-period; check for",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Posterior won't converge (high R-hat, divergences) → tighten priors,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "reparameterize, increase samples; check for collinear predictors.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-22-marketing-mix-modeling/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
